---
/**
 * Footer Astro con informazioni aziendali ufficiali, dati fiscali, orari e link Admin.
 */
---

<footer class="bg-brand-dark text-white/80 pt-16 pb-12 border-t border-brand-dark/20 mt-20">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-10 mb-12">
      
      {/* Colonna 1: Brand & Dati Fiscali */}
      <div class="space-y-4 md:col-span-1">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3.5">
          <img
            src="/logo.jpeg"
            alt="Brilla Cafe Logo"
            class="w-20 h-20 sm:w-24 sm:h-24 rounded-2xl object-cover shadow-xl border-2 border-white/25 flex-shrink-0"
          />
          <div>
            <span class="text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-white block leading-tight">
              Brilla <span class="text-brand-amber font-light">Cafe’</span>
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs text-white/70 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">
              Bar · Cartoleria · Edicola
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-white/70 leading-relaxed">
          <strong>Brilla SAS di Bricchi Sara e c.</strong><br />
          Il tuo punto di riferimento a Castelnuovo Bocca d'Adda per articoli scolastici, cancelleria, edicola del mese e idee regalo.
        </p>
        
        <div class="pt-2 text-[11px] text-white/60 space-y-1 border-t border-white/10">
          <p>📍 <strong>Sede:</strong> Via Umberto I, 35 – 26843 Castelnuovo Bocca d’Adda (LO)</p>
          <p>🏢 <strong>P.IVA:</strong> 11824030966</p>
          <p>📄 <strong>Codice SDI:</strong> W7YVJK9</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Colonna 2: Categorie Veloci */}
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">I Nostri Reparti</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li>
            <a href="/catalogo?tipo=cartoleria" class="hover:text-brand-amber transition-colors flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-badge-cartoleria"></span>
              Cartoleria Scuola &amp; Ufficio
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/catalogo?tipo=edicola" class="hover:text-brand-amber transition-colors flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-badge-edicola"></span>
              Edicola, Quotidiani &amp; Riviste
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/catalogo?tipo=bar_gift" class="hover:text-brand-amber transition-colors flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-badge-gift"></span>
              Bar, Tazze &amp; Gadget Regalo
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/catalogo" class="hover:text-brand-amber transition-colors text-brand-amber font-medium">
              → Tutto il Catalogo Online
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* Colonna 3: Orari di Apertura */}
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Orari di Apertura</h4>
        <div class="text-xs text-white/70 space-y-1.5">
          <p><strong class="text-white font-medium">Lunedì – Sabato:</strong> 06:30 – 19:30</p>
          <p><strong class="text-white font-medium">Domenica:</strong> 07:00 – 13:00</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Colonna 4: Contatti Diretti & WhatsApp */}
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Contatti</h4>
        <div class="text-xs text-white/70 space-y-1.5">
          <p>📞 <strong>Telefono / WhatsApp:</strong><br />
            <a href="tel:+393500206743" class="text-white hover:text-brand-amber font-semibold transition-colors">
              +39 350 020 6743
            </a>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-2">
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/393500206743?text=Ciao%20Brilla%20Cafe%E2%80%99,%20vorrei%20informazioni%20su%20un%20prodotto"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2.5 bg-[#25D366] hover:bg-[#20ba59] text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-xl transition-all shadow-sm"
          >
            <span>💬 Scrivici su WhatsApp</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    {/* Bottom bar con dati legali e copyright */}
    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-white/10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-white/40">
      <p>
        © {new Date().getFullYear()} Brilla SAS di Bricchi Sara e c. · P.IVA 11824030966 · Via Umberto I, 35, Castelnuovo Bocca d’Adda (LO).
      </p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
        <a href="/catalogo" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Catalogo</a>
        <a href="/checkout" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Carrello &amp; Checkout</a>
        <a href="/privacy" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/cookie" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Cookie Policy</a>
        <a href="/admin" class="hover:text-brand-amber text-white/50 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1">
          🔒 <span>Area Riservata</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</footer>
